<div class="note-sheet form-sheet">
<div class="note-title center">Kiwi Air Customer Complaint Form</div>
<div class="note-line">Customer has been trying to make a booking using the internet</div>
<div class="note-subtitle">Booking details</div>
<div class="q note-line" id="q1"><b>Name:</b> Janet <b class="qnum">1</b><input class="textans inline-answer wide" id="a1"></div>
<div class="note-line"><b>Ticket details:</b> one adult and three children</div>
<div class="q note-line indent" id="q2">(Wellington to Christchurch) – four <b class="qnum">2</b><input class="textans inline-answer wide" id="a2"> tickets</div>
<div class="note-line"><b>Flight details:</b> November 10th – 15th</div>
<div class="q note-line" id="q3"><b>Time:</b> departing at <b class="qnum">3</b><input class="textans inline-answer wide" id="a3"> a.m.</div>
<div class="note-subtitle">Details of the problem</div>
<div class="note-line indent">• the website changes the rate for one child</div>
<div class="q note-line indent" id="q4">• the website keeps giving the customer <b class="qnum">4</b><input class="textans inline-answer wide" id="a4"> messages</div>
<div class="note-subtitle">Customer informed that Kiwi Air policy:</div>
<div class="q note-line indent" id="q5">• allows no more than <b class="qnum">5</b><input class="textans inline-answer wide" id="a5"> child fares per adult</div>
<div class="note-line indent">(this applies to domestic flights only)</div>
<div class="note-subtitle">Customer's reasons for complaint</div>
<div class="q note-line indent" id="q6">• none of her children are <b class="qnum">6</b><input class="textans inline-answer wide" id="a6"> years old or older</div>
<div class="q note-line indent" id="q7">• child passengers require less <b class="qnum">7</b><input class="textans inline-answer wide" id="a7"></div>
<div class="q note-line indent" id="q8">• the rule is unfair for large families and <b class="qnum">8</b><input class="textans inline-answer wide" id="a8"> groups</div>
<div class="note-subtitle">Customer invited to send written complaint</div>
<div class="q note-line indent" id="q9">• letter to go to the <b class="qnum">9</b><input class="textans inline-answer wide" id="a9"></div>
<div class="note-line indent">• reply predicted within a week</div>
<div class="q note-line indent" id="q10">• reference number: <b class="qnum">10</b><input class="textans inline-answer wide" id="a10"></div>
</div></div></div></section>
<section class="pane" id="tab2"><div class="section-card"><div class="section-head"><div><h2>Section 2</h2><p>Questions 11–20 · Linwood Apartment Complex</p></div><div class="tag">MCQ + Map Labelling</div></div><div class="group"><h3>Questions 11–14</h3><p class="inst">Choose the correct answer.</p><div class="q" id="q11"><div class="qt"><b>11</b> When was the first apartment complex completed?</div><div class="opts"><label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="q11" value="A"><span><b>A</b> 1 year ago</span></label><label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="q11" value="B"><span><b>B</b> 3 years ago</span></label><label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="q11" value="C"><span><b>C</b> 5 years ago</span></label></div></div><div class="q" id="q12"><div class="qt"><b>12</b> What does the manager say he enjoys most about the job?</div><div class="opts"><label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="q12" value="A"><span><b>A</b> resolving problems between residents</span></label><label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="q12" value="B"><span><b>B</b> dealing with financial matters</span></label><label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="q12" value="C"><span><b>C</b> organizing building maintenance</span></label></div></div><div class="q" id="q13"><div class="qt"><b>13</b> Regarding restrictions in the complex, the manager says</div><div class="opts"><label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="q13" value="A"><span><b>A</b> only some types of flowers can be planted</span></label><label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="q13" value="B"><span><b>B</b> only the interiors of apartments can be painted</span></label><label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="q13" value="C"><span><b>C</b> only certain colors can be used on the walls</span></label></div></div><div class="q" id="q14"><div class="qt"><b>14</b> What does the manager ask residents to do for the welcome party?</div><div class="opts"><label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="q14" value="A"><span><b>A</b> bring food</span></label><label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="q14" value="B"><span><b>B</b> prepare name tags</span></label><label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="q14" value="C"><span><b>C</b> decorate the hall</span></label></div></div></div>
